3月開始店休又剛好看到今天有限定所以來試試\n可能接下來幾天沒機會來了 希望之後有緣可以在這邊嚐到煮干類拉麵",null,[0,34]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrYmxsVlZuQlplbWhVWld0NFlWVldhSE5qYld3Mll6SkdiazR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrYmxsVlZuQlplbWhVWld0NFlWVldhSE5qYld3Mll6SkdiazR4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrYmxsVlZuQlplbWhVWld0NFlWVldhSE5qYld3Mll6SkdiazR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrYmxsVlZuQlplbWhVWld0NFlWVldhSE5qYld3Mll6SkdiazR4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrYmxsVlZuQlplbWhVWld0NFlWVldhSE5qYld3Mll6SkdiazR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15841010331632340335/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBrYmxsVlZuQlplbWhVWld0NFlWVldhSE5qYld3Mll6SkdiazR4UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,13427,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkbllVVnBZemhUZWt4YVVWaHNjbWw2YzJGbk4xRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1ca618e474bb30e1!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjdnYUVpYzhTekxaUVhscml6c2FnN1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkbllVVnBZemhUZWt4YVVWaHNjbWw2YzJGbk4xRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkbllVVnBZemhUZWt4YVVWaHNjbWw2YzJGbk4xRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkbllVVnBZemhUZWt4YVVWaHNjbWw2YzJGbk4xRRILMGRiZ3lmbmZ6VFcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qZG5ZVVZwWXpoVGVreGFVVmhzY21sNmMyRm5OMUUSCzBkYmd5Zm5melRXIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR4TC7dOQYphwqCzBkYmd5Zm5melRX\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,